    <h1 id='name'><a href='#name'>NAME</a></h1><div class='section' data-for='name'><div data-less>

<p>fopen - open a file</p>

</div><div data-more>
<p>fopen, fdopen, freopen - stream open functions</p>
</div></div><h1 id='library'><a href='#library'>LIBRARY</a></h1><div data-for='library' data-hide><div class='section' data-for='library'><div data-more>
<p>Standard C library (<code>libc</code>, <code>-lc</code>)</p>
</div></div></div><h1 id='synopsis'><a href='#synopsis'>SYNOPSIS</a></h1><div class='section' data-for='synopsis'><div data-less>

